    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n512" root="اذى" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَذِيَّةٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of 1. (IB.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [quasi-]
inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آذَاهُ</span>. (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آذَاهُ</span>;
(Msb;) or, as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَذَاةٌ</span></b> , a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَذِىَ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأَذَّى</span>; (M, K;) signifying <i>A thing that is disagreeable,</i> or <i>hateful,</i> or <i>evil, in a small degree.</i>
(K.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَذًى</span>.

